<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Contact Inquiry Received - Bdseducation.in</title>

  <style>
    body, table, td, p, a, li, blockquote {
      -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
      -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
    }

    img {
      -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic;
      border: 0;
      height: auto;
      outline: none;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .email-container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background: #ffffff;
    }

    /* Header */
    .header {
      background: #ffffff;
      padding: 30px 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .logo-wrapper {
      width: 100%;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .logo-img {
      width: 200px;
      margin: 20px auto 10px auto;
      display: block;
    }

    /* Main Content */
    .content {
      background-color: #ffffff;
      padding: 40px 30px;
    }

    .greeting {
      color: #1f2d3d;
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin: 0 0 20px 0;
    }

    .intro-text {
      color: #3c4858;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    /* Inquiry Details Box */
    .inquiry-box {
      background-color: #f8f9fa;
      border-left: 4px solid #39A935;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 30px 0;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }

    .inquiry-detail {
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .detail-label {
      color: #39A935;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 14px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 5px;
    }

    .detail-value {
      color: #3c4858;
      font-size: 15px;
      word-break: break-word;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    /* CTA Button */
    .action-button {
      display: inline-block;
      background-color: #39A935;
      color: #ffffff !important;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 14px 28px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }

    /* Support text */
    .support-text {
      font-size: 15px;
      color: #4a5568;
      margin: 30px 0 10px;
    }

    .support-email {
      color: #00AEEF;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .timeline-text {
      color: #6c757d;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-style: italic;
      margin-top: 15px;
    }

    /* Footer */
    .footer {
      background-color: #5FBA47;
      padding: 30px 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .footer-text {
      color: #eaf6e8;
      font-size: 14px;
      margin: 0 0 10px 0;
    }

    .footer-link {
      color: #ffffff;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .footer-link:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {
      .email-container { width: 100% !important; }
      .content { padding: 30px 20px !important; }
      .inquiry-box { padding: 15px !important; }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #eef3f8;">
  <div class="email-container">

    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="header">
      <div class="logo-wrapper">
        <img
          src="https://bdseducation.in/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo.png&w=256&q=75"
          class="logo-img"
          alt="BDS Education"
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="content">
      <h2 class="greeting">Hello <%= name %>,</h2>

      <p class="intro-text">
        Thank you for reaching out to us! We have received your contact inquiry and truly appreciate you getting in touch with BDS Education.
      </p>

      <p class="intro-text">
        Here's a summary of the information you provided:
      </p>

      <!-- Inquiry Details -->
      <div class="inquiry-box">
        <div class="inquiry-detail">
          <div class="detail-label">📝 Name</div>
          <div class="detail-value"><%= name %></div>
        </div>

        <div class="inquiry-detail">
          <div class="detail-label">📧 Email</div>
          <div class="detail-value"><%= email %></div>
        </div>

        <div class="inquiry-detail">
          <div class="detail-label">📞 Phone</div>
          <div class="detail-value"><%= phone %></div>
        </div>

        <div class="inquiry-detail">
          <div class="detail-label">💬 Message</div>
          <div class="detail-value"><%= message %></div>
        </div>

        <div class="inquiry-detail">
          <div class="detail-label">🕐 Submitted On</div>
          <div class="detail-value"><%= submittedDate %></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="intro-text">
        Our team will review your inquiry and get back to you as soon as possible. We typically respond within 24-48 hours during business days.
      </p>

      <p class="intro-text">
        In the meantime, feel free to explore our website and resources. If you have any additional questions, you can always reply to this email or contact us directly.
      </p>

      <p style="text-align: center;">
        <a href="https://bdseducation.in/" class="action-button">Visit Our Website</a>
      </p>

      <p class="support-text">
        Need immediate assistance? Contact our support team at
        <a href="mailto:support@bdseducation.in" class="support-email">
          support@bdseducation.in
        </a>.
      </p>

      <p class="timeline-text">
        ✓ Your inquiry has been recorded and assigned a reference ID for tracking purposes.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <div class="footer">
      <p class="footer-text">Best regards,</p>
      <p class="footer-text"><strong>Team BDS Education</strong></p>
      <p class="footer-text">
        <a href="https://bdseducation.in/" class="footer-link">
          www.bdseducation.in
        </a>
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</body>
</html>